const rewardButtons={},rewardNames={hourly:'Boost chest',tickets:'Ticket case',skin:'Ruby case'},rewardLabels={tickets:'Pushcat tickets',rubies:'rubies',fairy:'fairy',skin:'skin',protection:'failure protection',enhancement:'enhancement boost',selling:'double-sale boost'};
function rewardOddsText(kind){const cost=game.rewardCost(kind),rules=ECONOMY.chests;if(kind==='hourly')return ` One free opening every ${duration(rules.freeBoostCooldownMs)}. Gold price follows your highest unlocked material tier. Up to ${rules.hourly.paidLimit} paid openings per ${rules.hourly.paidWindowMs/60000} active minutes; paid openings keep the free timer. Each opening awards one boost type.`;const expected=game.rewardExpectations(kind,window.brewerCharacter||'Pio'),parts=['tickets','rubies'].filter(key=>expected[key]>0).map(key=>Number(expected[key].toFixed(2))+' '+rewardLabels[key]),returned=Object.entries(expected).reduce((sum,[key,amount])=>sum+(CURRENCY_UNITS[key]?amount/CURRENCY_UNITS[key]:0),0),paid=cost.amount/CURRENCY_UNITS[cost.currency];return ` Average currency return: ${parts.join(' + ')} (${Number((returned/paid*100).toFixed(2))}% at Bank rates). Fairy and new-skin value excluded. Fairies below level 10 are equally likely; all maxed converts a fairy roll to ${rules.maxFairyTickets} tickets.`+(kind==='skin'?` Eligible current-character skins are equally likely; event skins are excluded. Duplicates convert to ${rules.duplicateTickets} tickets. Each opening has its own odds; no guaranteed skin after a fixed number of openings.`:'');}
function rewardArt(currency,name=''){if(currency==='skin')return game.state.activeCostumeId;if(currency==='fairy')return FAIRIES.find(f=>f.name===name)?.image||FAIRIES[0].image;return currency==='tickets'?'Nyan-Ticket.png':currency==='rubies'?'Gem.png':DATA.powerups[currency].image;}
function rewardDescription(result){return result.currency==='skin'?(result.name?'Unlocked '+result.name:'Random skin'):result.currency==='fairy'?(result.name||'Random fairy')+' ×1':(result.name?result.name+' → ':'')+result.amount+' '+rewardLabels[result.currency];}
for(const[kind,icon]of [['hourly','RewardIcon1.png'],['tickets','RewardIcon2.png'],['skin','RewardIconFairy.png']]){
 const button=document.createElement('button'),image=document.createElement('img'),title=document.createElement('span'),detail=document.createElement('small');image.src=art(icon);image.alt='';title.textContent=rewardNames[kind];button.append(image,title,detail);
 button.onclick=()=>{rewardKind=kind;rewardDialog.querySelector('h2').textContent=rewardNames[kind];rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-result').textContent='';rewardDialog.querySelector('.case-reel').replaceChildren();const rows=game.rewardPool(kind),total=rows.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.weight,0);let odds=rows.map(r=>(100*r.weight/total).toFixed(2).replace(/\.00$/,'')+'%: '+r.amount+' '+rewardLabels[r.currency]).join(' · ');odds+=rewardOddsText(kind);rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-odds').textContent=odds;updateRewardShop();rewardDialog.showModal();};rewardButtons[kind]={button,detail};rewardShop.append(button);
}
$('game-menu-shops').querySelector('h3').after(rewardShop);
const questMark=document.createElement('img');questMark.className='quest-mark';questMark.src=art('QuestMark.png');questMark.alt='';$('visitor-shortcut').append(questMark);
function updateRewardShop(){const s=game.state,quota=game.paidBoostInfo();for(const kind of ['hourly','tickets','skin']){const cost=game.rewardCost(kind);setText(rewardButtons[kind].detail,fmt(cost.amount)+' '+(cost.currency==='coins'?'gold':cost.currency));}setText(rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-balance'),fmt(s.coins)+' gold · '+fmt(s.tickets)+' tickets · '+fmt(s.rubies)+' rubies');const button=rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-open'),cost=game.rewardCost(rewardKind),noSkinPool=rewardKind==='skin'&&!game.eligibleSkins(window.brewerCharacter||'Pio').length;button.disabled=rewardBusy||s[cost.currency]<cost.amount||(rewardKind==='hourly'&&quota.remaining<1)||noSkinPool;setText(button,rewardBusy?'Opening…':noSkinPool?'No eligible skins':rewardKind==='hourly'&&quota.remaining<1?'Paid openings used':'Open · '+fmt(cost.amount)+' '+(cost.currency==='coins'?'gold':cost.currency));const freeButton=rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-free'),remaining=Math.max(0,s.rewardReadyAt-Date.now());freeButton.hidden=rewardKind!=='hourly';freeButton.disabled=rewardBusy||remaining>0;setText(freeButton,rewardBusy?'Opening…':remaining?'Free in '+duration(remaining):'Open free');const gold=fmt(game.rewardCost('hourly').amount);setText(rewardButtons.hourly.detail,(remaining?gold+' gold · free in '+duration(remaining):'Free ready · or '+gold+' gold')+' · '+quota.remaining+' paid left');const note=rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-quota');note.hidden=rewardKind!=='hourly';setText(note,`${quota.remaining} / ${quota.limit} paid openings left · refresh in ${duration(quota.remainingMs)} of active play`);if(rewardDialog.open){const rows=game.rewardPool(rewardKind),total=rows.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.weight,0);setText(rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-odds'),rows.map(r=>Number((100*r.weight/total).toFixed(2))+'%: '+r.amount+' '+rewardLabels[r.currency]).join(' · ')+rewardOddsText(rewardKind));}}
async function openChest(free=false){
 if(rewardBusy)return;const result=game.openReward(rewardKind,window.brewerCharacter||'Pio',Date.now(),Math.random,free);if(!result)return;save(true);render();rewardBusy=true;updateRewardShop();
 const output=rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-result'),reel=rewardDialog.querySelector('.case-reel');output.textContent='';reel.replaceChildren();rewardAnimation?.cancel();reel.style.transform='none';
 const pool=game.rewardPool(rewardKind),total=pool.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.weight,0);
 function previewReward(){let roll=Math.random()*total;for(const row of pool){if(roll<row.weight)return row;roll-=row.weight;}return pool[pool.length-1];}
 const cards=38;
 for(let i=0;i<cards;i++){const prize=cards===1||i===32?result:previewReward(),card=document.createElement('div'),image=document.createElement('img'),label=document.createElement('span');card.className='case-item';image.src=art(rewardArt(prize.currency,prize.name));image.alt='';label.textContent=rewardDescription(prize);card.append(image,label);reel.append(card);}
 if(cards>1){const target=rewardDialog.querySelector('.case-window').clientWidth/2-32*120-56;rewardAnimation=reel.animate([{transform:'translateX(0)'},{transform:'translateX('+target+'px)'}],{duration:reducedMotion?0:ECONOMY.chests.revealMs,easing:'cubic-bezier(.12,.72,.12,1)',fill:'forwards'});try{await rewardAnimation.finished;}catch{}}
 output.textContent='You received '+rewardDescription(result)+'!';rewardBusy=false;updateRewardShop();notice(output.textContent,'success');
};
rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-open').onclick=()=>openChest();
rewardDialog.querySelector('.reward-free').onclick=()=>openChest(true);
rewardDialog.addEventListener('close',()=>{rewardAnimation?.finish();});
setInterval(updateRewardShop,1000);updateRewardShop();

// Browser preferences are separate from transferable gameplay saves.
function applyGameSettings(){reducedMotion=gameSettings.reducedMotion;const root=document.documentElement;root.dataset.reducedMotion=String(reducedMotion);root.dataset.shortcuts=String(gameSettings.shortcuts);root.dataset.textSize=gameSettings.textSize;if(music)music.volume=gameSettings.musicVolume;visitorBell.volume=gameSettings.effectsVolume;if(!gameSettings.idleDialogue)window.clearIdleDialogue?.();if(reducedMotion)rewardAnimation?.finish();}
for(const key of Object.keys(gameSettings)){const control=$('setting-'+key);control.type==='checkbox'?control.checked=gameSettings[key]:control.value=String(gameSettings[key]);control.oninput=()=>{gameSettings[key]=control.type==='checkbox'?control.checked:control.tagName==='SELECT'&&key==='textSize'?control.value:Number(control.value);applyGameSettings();try{localStorage.setItem(SETTINGS_KEY,JSON.stringify(gameSettings));$('settings-message').textContent='Settings saved on this browser.';}catch{$('settings-message').textContent='Settings apply now, but could not be saved.';}};}
$('settings-save-now').onclick=()=>{$('save-now').click();$('settings-save-status').textContent=$('save-status').textContent;};$('settings-save-tools').onclick=()=>{gameMenu.close();$('save-dialog').showModal();};
new MutationObserver(()=>$('settings-save-status').textContent=$('save-status').textContent).observe($('save-status'),{childList:true,characterData:true,subtree:true});$('settings-save-status').textContent=$('save-status').textContent;
let effectAudio=null;document.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(!gameSettings.effectsVolume||!event.target.closest('button:not(:disabled)'))return;try{const Audio=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext;if(!Audio)return;effectAudio??=new Audio();if(effectAudio.state==='suspended')void effectAudio.resume().catch(()=>{});const oscillator=effectAudio.createOscillator(),gain=effectAudio.createGain(),now=effectAudio.currentTime;oscillator.frequency.value=660;gain.gain.setValueAtTime(gameSettings.effectsVolume*.08,now);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,now+.06);oscillator.connect(gain);gain.connect(effectAudio.destination);oscillator.start(now);oscillator.stop(now+.06);oscillator.onended=()=>{oscillator.disconnect();gain.disconnect();};}catch{}});
applyGameSettings();

function claimAllMailGifts(){if(saveBlocked)return;const rubies=game.state.rubies,claims=[...game.state.claimedUpdates],reward=game.claimAllUpdates();if(reward===null){setText($('mail-status'),'No gifts available, or your ruby balance cannot hold them.');return;}save(true);if(!saveOK||saveBlocked){game.state.rubies=rubies;game.state.claimedUpdates=claims;saveDirty=true;setText($('mail-status'),'Could not save your gifts. Nothing was claimed; please free browser storage and try again.');refreshMail.key=null;refreshMail();return;}render();setText($('mail-status'),'Thank you for playing! Received '+reward+' rubies from all pending gifts.');}
$('mail-claim-all').onclick=claimAllMailGifts;
function refreshMail(){const pending=UPDATES.entries.filter(update=>!game.state.claimedUpdates.includes(update.id));setText($('mail-count'),pending.length?pending.length+(pending.length===1?' gift':' gifts'):'Up to date');const claimAll=$('mail-claim-all');claimAll.disabled=!pending.length||saveBlocked;setText(claimAll,pending.length?'Claim all · '+pending.reduce((n,u)=>n+u.rubies,0)+' rubies':'All gifts claimed');const key=JSON.stringify([game.state.claimedUpdates,saveBlocked,game.state.rubies]);if(refreshMail.key===key)return;refreshMail.key=key;const box=$('mail-updates');box.replaceChildren();for(const update of UPDATES.entries){const card=document.createElement('article'),date=document.createElement('small'),title=document.createElement('h4'),list=document.createElement('ul'),button=document.createElement('button'),icon=document.createElement('img'),claimed=game.state.claimedUpdates.includes(update.id);card.className='update-mail';date.textContent=update.date;title.textContent=update.title;for(const text of update.notes){const item=document.createElement('li');item.textContent=text;list.append(item);}button.type='button';button.disabled=claimed||saveBlocked;icon.src=art('Gem.png');icon.alt='';button.append(icon,claimed?'Claimed':saveBlocked?'Restore saving to claim':'Claim '+update.rubies);button.onclick=()=>{const rubies=game.state.rubies,claims=[...game.state.claimedUpdates],reward=game.claimUpdate(update.id);if(reward===null)return;save(true);if(!saveOK||saveBlocked){game.state.rubies=rubies;game.state.claimedUpdates=claims;saveDirty=true;$('mail-status').textContent='Could not save your claim. Free up browser storage and try again.';refreshMail.key=null;refreshMail();return;}render();$('mail-status').textContent='Thank you for playing! Received '+reward+' rubies.';};card.append(date,title,list,button);box.append(card);}}
window.refreshMail=refreshMail;refreshMail();

function pinDialogHeader(dialog){if(dialog.querySelector(':scope > .dialog-header'))return;const title=Array.from(dialog.children).find(node=>node.matches('h2,h3'));if(!title)return;const header=document.createElement('header');header.className='dialog-header';dialog.prepend(header);while(header.nextSibling){const node=header.nextSibling;header.append(node);if(node===title)break;}for(const page of dialog.querySelectorAll('.game-menu-subpage')){const heading=Array.from(page.children).find(node=>node.matches('h3'));if(!heading)continue;const subheader=document.createElement('div');subheader.className='dialog-subheader';page.prepend(subheader);while(subheader.nextSibling){const node=subheader.nextSibling;subheader.append(node);if(node===heading)break;}}const resize=new ResizeObserver(()=>dialog.style.setProperty('--dialog-header-height',header.getBoundingClientRect().height+'px'));resize.observe(header);}
function addMenuReturn(dialog){if(dialog.id!=='game-menu'&&!dialog.querySelector('[data-back-to-menu]')){const button=document.createElement('button');button.type='button';button.className='back-to-menu';button.dataset.backToMenu='';button.textContent='← Back to menu';button.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('dialog[open]').forEach(open=>open.close());$('game-menu-open').click();};const close=dialog.querySelector('.close');if(close)close.after(button);else dialog.prepend(button);}pinDialogHeader(dialog);}

document.querySelectorAll('dialog').forEach(addMenuReturn);
new MutationObserver(records=>{for(const record of records)for(const node of record.addedNodes){if(node.nodeType===1&&node.matches('dialog'))addMenuReturn(node);}}).observe(document.body,{childList:true});

const helperCatElements=new Map();
function syncHelperCats(){const helpers=game.state.helpers,ingredients=$('ingredients'),left=ingredients.offsetLeft||0,width=ingredients.clientWidth;for(const[h,node]of helperCatElements)if(!helpers.includes(h)){node.remove();helperCatElements.delete(h);}helpers.forEach((h,index)=>{let node=helperCatElements.get(h);if(!node){node=document.createElement('div');node.className='conveyor-cat';const image=document.createElement('img'),timer=document.createElement('small');image.src=art(h.kind==='blackcat'?'BlackcatDialogue.png':'PushcatDialogue.png');image.alt=h.kind==='blackcat'?'Blackcat helper':'Pushcat helper';node.append(image,timer);ingredients.parentElement.append(node);helperCatElements.set(h,node);}const position=(left+width*(h.slot+.5)/ECONOMY.helpers.maxActive)+'px';if(node.style.left!==position)node.style.left=position;setText(node.querySelector('small'),Math.ceil(h.remainingMs/1000)+'s');node.title=(h.kind==='blackcat'?'Blackcat':'Pushcat')+' · '+Math.ceil(h.remainingMs/1000)+' working seconds left';});}
function animateIngredient(family,tier,id=null,helper=null,kind=null){if(reducedMotion)return;const source=id!==null?beltElements.get(id):$('ingredients').children[family],target=document.querySelector(kind==='ticket'?'#tickets-display':kind==='solution'?'.solution-balance':'.liquid');if(!source||!target)return;const from=source.getBoundingClientRect(),to=target.getBoundingClientRect(),image=document.createElement('img'),x=from.left+from.width/2-20,y=from.top+from.height/2-20,dx=to.left+to.width/2-20-x,dy=to.top+to.height/2-20-y;image.src=art(kind==='ticket'?'Nyan-Ticket.png':kind==='solution'?'WikiPotion.png':FAMILIES[family].materials[tier].image);image.alt='';image.className='falling-ingredient';image.style.left=x+'px';image.style.top=y+'px';document.body.append(image);const flight=image.animate([{transform:'translate(0,0) scale(1)',opacity:1},{transform:`translate(${dx*.35}px,${Math.min(-24,dy*.15)}px) rotate(-15deg) scale(.95)`,opacity:1,offset:.3},{transform:`translate(${dx}px,${dy}px) rotate(25deg) scale(.35)`,opacity:0}],{duration:480,easing:'ease-in',fill:'forwards'});flight.finished.catch(()=>{}).finally(()=>image.remove());const cat=helperCatElements.get(helper);if(cat){cat.getAnimations().forEach(a=>a.cancel());cat.animate([{transform:'translate(-50%,0)'},{transform:'translate(-50%,-28px)',offset:.4},{transform:'translate(-50%,0)'}],{duration:Math.max(80,Math.min(300,helper.intervalMs*.85)),easing:'ease-out'});}}
function renderHelper(){const helpers=game.state.helpers,info=game.helperInfo(),button=$('pushcat-summon');button.disabled=helpers.length>=ECONOMY.helpers.maxActive||game.state.tickets<ECONOMY.helpers.ticketCost;setText($('pushcat-label'),'Summon Pushcat');setText($('pushcat-status'),helpers.length?helpers.length+' / '+ECONOMY.helpers.maxActive+' cats · '+(!game.state.potion?'Paused':'Working'):'1 ticket');button.title=`1 ticket · ${(info.durationMs/1000).toFixed(1)} working seconds · ${(info.blackcatChance*100).toFixed(1)}% Blackcat chance · up to ${ECONOMY.helpers.maxActive} cats. Timers pause while empty, hidden or closed. Pushcat ${(info.intervalMs/1000).toFixed(2)}s / Blackcat ${(info.intervalMs/ECONOMY.helpers.blackcatSpeedMultiplier/1000).toFixed(2)}s per catch. ${info.durationMultiplier>1?'Event: double working time.':''} ${info.chanceMultiplier>1?'Event: 5× Blackcat odds.':''} Custom intervals and prices.`;syncHelperCats();}

$('pushcat-summon').onclick=()=>{const tickets=game.state.tickets,rubies=game.state.rubies,stats={...game.state.helperStats},helpers=[...game.state.helpers],kind=game.summonHelper();if(!kind)return;save(true);if(!saveOK||saveBlocked){game.state.tickets=tickets;game.state.rubies=rubies;game.state.helperStats=stats;game.state.helpers=helpers;saveDirty=true;notice('Could not save the summon. Your ticket was returned.');}else notice((kind==='blackcat'?'Blackcat':'Pushcat')+' is here to help! Pick the first ingredient to begin.','success');render();};window.refreshHelper=renderHelper;renderHelper();

function decorateGameText(root){if(!root)return;const nodes=[];if(root.nodeType===3)nodes.push(root);else if(root.nodeType===1){if(root.closest('script,style,textarea,input,select,option,pre,code,[contenteditable],.reward-chip,.ui-family'))return;const walker=document.createTreeWalker(root,NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT);while(walker.nextNode())nodes.push(walker.currentNode);}for(const node of nodes){const parent=node.parentElement;if(!parent||parent.closest('script,style,textarea,input,select,option,pre,code,[contenteditable],.reward-chip,.ui-family'))continue;const text=node.nodeValue,pattern=/\b(Life|Mana|Stamina)\b|\b(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)\s+(failure protection(?: charges?)?|protection(?: charges?)?|enhancement(?: bonus(?:es)?)?(?: charges?)?|double-sale(?: charges?)?|selling(?: bonus(?:es)?)?(?: charges?)?|sale boost(?: charges?)?|Pushcat tickets?|tickets?|rubies|ruby|likeability|expedition stamps?|stamps?)\b/g;let match,last=0,fragment=null;while((match=pattern.exec(text))){fragment??=document.createDocumentFragment();fragment.append(document.createTextNode(text.slice(last,match.index)));if(match[1]){const span=document.createElement('span');span.className='ui-family';span.textContent=match[1];span.style.color=FAMILIES.find(f=>f.label===match[1]).color;fragment.append(span);}else{const label=match[3],kind=/protection/.test(label)?'protection':/enhancement/.test(label)?'enhancement':/double-sale|selling|sale boost/.test(label)?'selling':/ticket/.test(label)?'tickets':/rub/.test(label)?'rubies':/likeability/.test(label)?'likeability':'stamps';fragment.append(rewardChip(kind,match[2]));}last=pattern.lastIndex;}if(fragment){fragment.append(document.createTextNode(text.slice(last)));node.replaceWith(fragment);}}}
decorateGameText(document.body);const presentationObserver=new MutationObserver(changes=>{const roots=new Set();for(const change of changes){if(change.type==='characterData')roots.add(change.target);else for(const node of change.addedNodes)roots.add(node);}for(const root of roots)if(root.isConnected)decorateGameText(root);});presentationObserver.observe(document.body,{childList:true,subtree:true,characterData:true});
